      "title": "Image to Prompt Formula",
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "PixaromaText",
        "cnr_id": "ComfyUI-Pixaroma",
        "ver": "c82f95989e0347b5cc48ddf52a51f2d776a1f83b"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Analyze the image and create one detailed music prompt for Stable Audio 3 Medium.\n\nThe prompt must describe music that fits the visual mood, subject, style, colors, setting, and emotional tone of the image. Convert visual elements into musical choices.\n\nInclude:\ngenre, subgenre, instrumentation, rhythm, tempo or BPM, mood, arrangement, production style, sound texture, and cinematic use case.\n\nRules:\nOutput only one final music prompt.\nDo not describe the image directly unless it helps the music.\nDo not mention Stable Audio.\nDo not use bullet points.\nDo not add explanations.\nDo not write labels like Genre, Mood, BPM, TrackType, or Music.\nDo not include vocals unless the image clearly suggests vocal textures.\nIf vocals are included, make them wordless, non-lyrical, or atmospheric.\nKeep the prompt between 70 and 120 words.\nMake it suitable for an instrumental music generation model.\n\nCreate a polished prompt that sounds like a professional music direction brief.",
        ""
      ],
      "color": "#1d1d1d",
      "bgcolor": "#2a2a2a"
    },
